      yet.
    laps: 15
    hurdles: 0
  - label: HURDLES
    sceneName: RooftopRace
    hint: One lap over hurdles that fall over when they are hit. No policy has been
      trained to jump one, so this is a running race through furniture.
    laps: 1
    hurdles: 1
  - label: LONG JUMP
    sceneName: RooftopLongJump
    hint: Pick 1 to 16 jumpers. Three rounds each on the infield runway; best mark
      wins.
    laps: 0
    hurdles: 0
